{"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each event the tracker rejected because a property broke a constraint declared"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on it, in the order the rejections happen."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/rejectionreports"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/rejectionReports"},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"Tracker.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Tracker.swift#L214"},"title":"rejectionReports","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rejectionReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncStream","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"RejectionReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers15RejectionReportV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"externalID":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV16rejectionReportsScSyAA15RejectionReportVGvp"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rejectionReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncStream","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"RejectionReport","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/RejectionReport","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers15RejectionReportV"},{"text":"> { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tracker’s worker checks each event’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"constraintViolation()"},{"type":"text","text":" before anything else, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rejected event is never enriched, held by a consent, written to a store or delivered. A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"record a store recovered is checked too, and one rejected is forgotten by the store. In"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"debug builds each rejection is also logged at error level."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reports wait until they are read, merged: a rejection joins the waiting report of the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event, property and keyword, adding to its count and widening its timestamps. So the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reports waiting unread are at most one per constraint the app declares, however many events"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"break them. Copies of a tracker share one sequence, which has one consumer and ends once the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker has finished. A "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp"},{"type":"text","text":" tracker’s is empty."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/RejectionReport":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/RejectionReport","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RejectionReport","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/rejectionreport","title":"RejectionReport","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"RejectionReport","kind":"identifie